The optional training backend installs and executes an unmodified, pinned
SimpleTuner distribution as a separate program. SimpleTuner is licensed under
AGPL-3.0-or-later and is not copied into this repository.

On Windows, the backend installer builds TrainingSample 0.3.1 from its verified
MIT-licensed source archive with the OpenCV image/video feature disabled. The
Music 3 audio training path does not use that feature.

The managed Windows environment includes this project's fcntl compatibility
module. It adapts SimpleTuner's cache-file flock calls to msvcrt.locking without
modifying the SimpleTuner distribution.

MiniMax Music 3 model artifacts remain subject to their respective model
licenses. Downloading them requires an explicit user action.

The optional MOSS-Music preprocessing model and its pinned remote model code
are downloaded from OpenMOSS-Team and executed in a separate environment.
MOSS-Music is Apache-2.0 licensed and is not copied into this repository.
